WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Welcome to Wondercase. Begin in Hanoi on November 16; the tour ends in Bangkok on December 1. Follow Vietnam, Cambodia and Thailand in the order shown on Home. This illustrated video has captions. Pause, replay or choose a chapter at any time.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Install on your phone. Open the app link in Safari on iPhone or Chrome on Android. Choose Add to Home Screen (or Install app), then confirm. Browser wording can vary. Use More → Help & Tutorials for the detailed iPhone and Android videos.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Your daily schedule. Home shows each day’s date, city and schedule. Choose a day with the arrows or calendar. November 16–20: Hanoi, Hue, Da Nang and Hoi An. November 21–22: Saigon. November 23–24: Siem Reap and Angkor. November 25–27: Chiang Mai. November 28–December 1: Bangkok. Times can change; follow Xavier’s updates.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Explore with Xavier’s maps. Tap Hanoi, Da Nang, Saigon, Siem Reap, Chiang Mai or Bangkok on the large map to open Xavier’s map. Angkor Wat opens Xavier’s Siem Reap map. Hue uses its available uploaded map or a Google search. City tiles below the map offer the same maps and any additional maps Xavier shares.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Essentials for the journey. Open Essentials for hotel details, internal flights, local guides and available handouts. Vedana Lagoon Resort on November 19 is a lunch stop, not an overnight hotel. Review shared documents online. Download a needed PDF before setting out; current flight and schedule updates take priority.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Join our photo gallery. Tap Gallery. It opens the group’s photo gallery directly. If you have not joined on this browser, follow the gallery’s Join instructions. Returning members enter according to the gallery’s saved membership. Safe sign-in does not sign you into the gallery.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:24.000
The Group and meal choices. Xavier reveals the guest list when it is ready. Your guest card includes Safe and Meal choices links. Open Meal choices from your guest card and add dietary restrictions or allergies at the top. Choose the meals Xavier has made visible. Submit each meal or all open meals, and check the confirmation and deadline on each menu.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Your private Traveler Safe. Open your own guest card’s Safe. Activate your assigned Safe ID with a six-digit PIN on your first visit. Keep the recovery code somewhere private. Return with your Safe ID and PIN; use recovery if needed. Save personal PDFs or photos and calendar plans in your Safe. Lock it when finished; downloaded files remain on your device.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Discover more. Open More → Learn More for historical trivia about places on this itinerary. Choose the Language lessons tile for useful local phrases. Use Help Wondercase Grow to share feedback. Return on the same browser and device to update it.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Help whenever you need it. The video and printable booklet follow this November 16–December 1 itinerary. They explain app controls, not a fixed promise of activity times. Internet is needed for updated schedules, Safe content and shared photos. Downloaded PDFs and videos can be opened on your device. Use The Group for Xavier’s contact details. Never include passwords, invitation links or private documents in feedback.
